ic set of people  who would be potential targets for you  but that's good you don't want to go  after anybody and everybody right you  don't want the person who is just in it  to try to make some money we doesn't  really care about beauty products  doesn't really want to help people  they're just trying to you know do a  cash grab that's not going to be your  ideal type of person you want somebody  who really has a passion for your  products and really likes helping people  and if  can really focus your attention finding  those people it may be a lot fewer  immediately bring in a couple people a  year instead of 100 people a year but  those couple people would be really  focused on helping you grow your  business and the right type of people to  bring on board so it's also a lot more  fun you know if you're working with  people who love what they're doing and  they're helping your customers and your  customers are you know getting great  results as well then it's a lot more fun  you've seen the value that you're adding  the people's lives and that's really  what being an entrepreneur is all about  the second thing I just quickly advise  you to do once you found those right  people you want to make sure that you  train them well and that you make it as  easy as possible for them to start  making money you want to set them up for  success as best you can so really make  sure you're spending the time with them  coaching them guiding them through the  process making it easy for them you'd be  give them a few leads go with the Mon  sales calls try to make it as easy as  possible really invest your time again  you're investing more time in fewer  people who think are really you know a  candidates for you instead of a lot of  time invested across you know 100 people  who are all media for candidates so if  they can get set up and feel comfortable  and confident and they're starting to  make money and they're seeing some early  success then it's going to be easier for  them to want to stick around and keep  going and and you basically get in the  past that survival stage is gonna be the  hardest part so hopefully that helps  Diana for those of you guys watching if  you liked the video please give it a  thumbs up below it always makes me want  to make more these videos for you guys  and I know you like them and if you have  a thought or comment I love to hear it  below if you want to leave it under the  video I always read those too so thank  you and we'll see you on the next  episode  you  you
 

